.TH WERKMEISTER-MACHINE-OPTIMIZE 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-machine\-optimize \- Analyze resource usage vs configured limits, recommend changes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister machine optimize\fR
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-collect <MINUTES>\fR
Collect stats over N minutes before analyzing (default: quick snapshot)
.TP
\fB\-i, \-\-interval <SECS>\fR
Sampling interval in seconds (default: 10)
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Compares running containers' actual usage with their configured limits, shows which services are over\- or under\-provisioned, and recommends changes.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
werkmeister machine optimize              # analyze current usage against the limits
werkmeister machine optimize \-\-collect 5  # collect for 5 minutes first, then analyze
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
